Throwing gems at unicorns gives various amounts of luck and
that can be valuable.  Even better, throwing glass at a unicorn
informs you "The unicorn is notinterested in your junk" but does
not cost luck.  So once you know the glass of some color you
can name by type other gems of that color - called gems give
+2, IDed gems give +5, killed unicorns give -5, all with safe
co-aligned unicorns.  Being able to tune luck to specific values
has occasional powerful uses though normally it's best to keep
luck maxed out.



